WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.109
Sarah: I can't believe Mittens is gone!

2
00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.276
Riley: Don't worry, Sarah.

3
00:00:12.277 --> 00:00:15.243
We'll find her.

4
00:00:15.244 --> 00:00:18.754
Sarah's Mom: She has to be here somewhere.

5
00:00:18.755 --> 00:00:26.099
Sarah: She could be alone and scared!

6
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.884
Theo: Mittens, where are you?

7
00:00:29.885 --> 00:00:37.446
Skyler: Here, kitty, kitty!

8
00:00:37.447 --> 00:00:40.952
Ben: Did you hear that?

9
00:00:40.953 --> 00:00:43.083
Skyler: Hear what?

10
00:00:43.084 --> 00:00:46.780
Ben: A cat meowing!

11
00:00:46.781 --> 00:00:49.354
Chatter: Meow, meow!

12
00:00:49.355 --> 00:00:52.829
Skyler: Quiet, Chatter. Listen.

13
00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:55.245
Sarah: I heard it again!

14
00:00:55.246 --> 00:01:00.881
Riley: So did I!

15
00:01:00.882 --> 00:01:04.391
Theo: There's a cat around here somewhere.

16
00:01:04.392 --> 00:01:05.959
Sarah: There it is!

17
00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.835
It's a kitten!

18
00:01:07.836 --> 00:01:12.821
Kitten: Meow! Meow!

19
00:01:12.822 --> 00:01:16.418
Sarah's Mom: What a cute kitten!

20
00:01:16.419 --> 00:01:19.928
Ben: I wonder where it came from.

21
00:01:19.929 --> 00:01:23.395
Sarah: It's very friendly!

22
00:01:23.396 --> 00:01:27.656
Theo: Maybe the magician did a super magic trick.

23
00:01:27.657 --> 00:01:32.488
Riley: And turned Mittens into a real kitten!

24
00:01:32.489 --> 00:01:35.065
Sarah: Really?

25
00:01:35.066 --> 00:01:38.835
Ben: I don't think a magician could do that.

26
00:01:38.836 --> 00:01:41.071
Chatter: Meow! Meow!

27
00:01:41.072 --> 00:01:45.289
Riley: Look! Chatter found Mittens.

28
00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:51.275
Skyler: She fell behind the stage.

29
00:01:51.276 --> 00:01:56.490
Sarah: Oh, Mittens, I'm so glad you're okay!

30
00:01:56.491 --> 00:02:01.600
Sarah's Mom: Whew! What a relief!

31
00:02:01.601 --> 00:02:04.112
Sarah: I'm so happy to see her.

32
00:02:04.113 --> 00:02:07.363
But I love this little kitten too!

33
00:02:07.364 --> 00:02:11.576
Riley: The kitten likes you too, Sarah.

34
00:02:11.577 --> 00:02:14.501
Sarah: Mom, can I keep it?

35
00:02:14.502 --> 00:02:17.563
Then I could have a real, live pet.

36
00:02:17.564 --> 00:02:20.164
Sarah's Mom: I don't know, Sarah.

37
00:02:20.165 --> 00:02:28.627
First we have to find its owner.

